{#- "Pulse": a row per month, newest at the top, bar length by post count.

    A different trade from the day calendar it alternates with. That one shows
    every day and deliberately uses one fill whatever the count, so it answers
    "did anything happen on the 14th?" but cannot show that September holds
    twenty posts and April three. This answers the opposite question.

    Twelve rows are shown and the rest scroll, so the component is the same
    height whether the archive is one year old or ten -- the only thing a long
    archive adds is scrolling, never width. The top row is the current month,
    not the last month with a post, so a quiet stretch reads as empty rows
    rather than as the chart stopping early.

    Hidden until the script runs: without JavaScript a bar does nothing. -#}
<div class="pulse" id="activity" hidden>
  {#- Whether there is more below is known here, so the fade that says so
      needs no JavaScript and cannot be wrong. #}
  <div class="pulse-window{% if activity.recent | length > 12 %} has-more{% endif %}">
    <div class="pulse-scroll" tabindex="0" role="group"
         aria-label="Posts by month, most recent first. Select a month to jump to it.">
      {%- for m in activity.recent %}
      {%- if m.count %}
      <button type="button" class="pmonth" data-day="{{ m.firstIso }}"
            data-page="{{ collections.posts | pageForDate(m.firstIso, site.perPage) }}"
            style="--v:{{ (m.count / activity.busiest) if activity.busiest else 0 }}"
            title="{{ m.label }}" aria-label="{{ m.label }}">
      <span class="pmonth-when">{%- if m.showYear %}<b>{{ m.year }}</b>{% endif %}{{ m.name }}</span>
      <span class="pmonth-track"><span class="pmonth-fill"></span></span>
      <span class="pmonth-count">{{ m.count }}</span>
    </button>
      {%- else %}
      {#- Nothing to jump to, so not a button -- the rule the calendar uses for
        empty days. #}
      <span class="pmonth is-empty" title="{{ m.label }}">
      <span class="pmonth-when">{%- if m.showYear %}<b>{{ m.year }}</b>{% endif %}{{ m.name }}</span>
      <span class="pmonth-track"></span>
      <span class="pmonth-count"></span>
    </span>
      {%- endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="pulse-legend">
    <span>{{ activity.total }} posts</span>
    <span>{{ activity.days }} days</span>
    <span>busiest {{ activity.busiest }}</span>
  </p>
</div>
